on · Internet access · Business technology</p></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>How remote support works</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Describe the problem</h3><p>Describe the problem so we can identify the right expertise.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Join a quick call</h3><p>Pick a time or ask for the next available technician. Get help remotely from wherever you are.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Pay by the minute</h3><p>Agree on the scope and rate before work starts. For a successful repair, you pay only for the time used.</p></div></div></div></section></Base>